#
# Module
#
ModuleEnableBankingName = Enable Banking
ModuleEnableBankingDesc = Synchronise bank accounts with Enable Banking (Open Banking PSD2), match transactions with invoices and reconcile automatically
EnableBanking = Enable Banking
EnableBankingDescription = Synchronise bank accounts with Enable Banking (Open Banking PSD2), match received and sent payments with customer and supplier invoices, and reconcile bank lines.
Permission51745001 = Read bank transactions imported from Enable Banking
Permission51745002 = Connect or disconnect a bank account with Enable Banking
Permission51745003 = Validate matches (create payments, link and reconcile bank lines)
EnableBankingCronSync = Enable Banking: import bank transactions
EnableBankingCronSyncComment = Imports booked transactions of linked accounts and computes match suggestions. Banks allow 4 background fetches per day and per account.

