# Setup
#
EnableBankingSetup = Enable Banking setup
EnableBankingSetupHelp = Create an application in the Enable Banking control panel (https://enablebanking.com/cp/applications), with the callback URL below, and paste here its id and the private key generated with it.
EnableBankingCallbackUrl = Redirect URL to declare in your Enable Banking application
EnableBankingCallbackUrlHelp = The bank sends the user back to this page after the authorisation. The user must be logged in Dolibarr.
