EnableBankingSureScoreHelp = A single candidate with at least this score is preselected for mass validation. Reference of invoice in the label = 50, IBAN of third party = 40, name = 25 (15 if partial), product or service of a line in the label = 20, amount = 10, line already entered = 60 (+20 same day).
